{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分段落把人物心理变化的因果过程压缩了，尤其S13，兴奋转为孤单、疑问再到平静的中间心理过程，文字交代不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过【】突出每段最重要的心理信息，感受文字又通过大小层级和音乐到时出现来分配注意力，普通观众更容易边听边抓住重点，也更容易感到音乐中的细微变化。它对声音质感、节奏、力度、旋律回归以及情绪转折的描写更具体，前后段落之间也有较强的音乐动机呼应。X的优势是人物心理的叙述更完整，尤其在解释为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去、为什么最终决定继续生活时，因果关系交代得更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d4198f25-c6d9-41f6-bc8b-7586e769310c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T155854134423Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:59:27.112919+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b927a424bf38f42d63f9de5505328676ee26232aec8186136a9c4e9a6d2c9b4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat